go 1.26.4

// Root module — plugin binary + generated pb stubs live here.
use .

// The neutral vocabulary (entity.v1) and its reader. A separate module so a
// plugin that only wants the shared names can depend on it without inheriting
// this one's dependency graph — see entity/go.mod for why that constraint exists.
use ./entity

// Examples are a separate module so their transitive deps (generated gRPC
// stubs, etc.) don't pollute the plugin's dependency graph.
use ./examples

// protokit's removal of protokit.v1 is unreleased. Both this module and entity/
// carry the same replace in their go.mod; it is repeated here because workspace
// mode resolves from go.work. Drop all three once protokit is tagged.
replace github.com/the-protobuf-project/protokit => ../protokit
